libcroco — CSS2 parser used by this librsvg tree
================================================

**Discontinued in the librsvg build.** This directory is not compiled
or linked. See `DISCONTINUED`. The only CSS engine is `css/`.

This is the archived in-tree CSS2 tokenizer and SAC/CSSOM parser.
The live stylesheet engine in librsvg is `css/`.

Version 0.6.15 is official GNOME 0.6.13 plus the patches listed in
NEWS. It is not stock GNOME 0.6.13. SONAME stays libcroco-0.6.so.3.

`@import` URLs are not fetched and will not be. This tree does not
ship a layout engine, mlview, or sewfox.
